# Reduce build context — these are either rebuilt inside the image or never needed
# at runtime. Mirrors .gitignore plus a few Docker-specific extras.

# Dependencies (re-installed inside the builder stage)
**/node_modules

# Build output (regenerated inside the builder stage)
**/dist
**/build
**/.vite

# Re-include pnpm deploy artifacts — Dockerfile.{app,sso,di} ship the prebuilt tree
# from `pnpm deploy --prod --legacy ./deploy/out/<name>/`, so the dist/ and
# node_modules/ inside deploy/out/** MUST NOT be filtered by the broad excludes above.
# Order matters here: in .dockerignore, later patterns override earlier ones.
!deploy/out/**

# Tests + coverage — never shipped to runtime
**/coverage
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/test
**/__tests__

# Env (NEVER bake secrets into the image)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Local-only docs and scratchpads
aTaskMngmt.local
**/README.local.md
**/CLAUDE.md
services/ax-data-integration/docs

# Logs
**/*.log
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/npm-debug.log*

# Editor / OS noise
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
**/*.swp

# Git
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Docker meta — no need to copy itself
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# CI configs not used at runtime
.github
